<footer class="bg-dark text-white-50 py-5 mt-auto border-top border-secondary border-opacity-25">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                    <span class="p-2 rounded-3 bg-primary text-white d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;">
                        <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-text-fill"></i>
                    </span>
                    <span class="fw-bold text-white fs-5">AI Resume<span class="text-primary">Analyzer</span></span>
                </div>
                <p class="small text-white-50">
                    A comprehensive, explainable ATS resume benchmarking platform developed for academic capstone evaluation in B.Tech Computer Engineering (Semester 5).
                </p>
                <div class="small text-muted">
                    Built with <strong>ASP.NET Core MVC</strong>, <strong>ADO.NET</strong>, and <strong>Microsoft SQL Server</strong>.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-6 col-md-2">
                <h6 class="text-white fw-bold mb-3">Platform</h6>
                <ul class="list-unstyled small mb-0">
                    <li class="mb-2"><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" class="text-white-50 text-decoration-none">Home</a></li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><a asp-controller="Resume" asp-action="Upload" class="text-white-50 text-decoration-none">Upload Resume</a></li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><a asp-controller="Analysis" asp-action="Create" class="text-white-50 text-decoration-none">Analyze ATS Match</a></li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><a asp-controller="Analysis" asp-action="History" class="text-white-50 text-decoration-none">Past Analyses</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                <h6 class="text-white fw-bold mb-3">Academic Context</h6>
                <ul class="list-unstyled small mb-0">
                    <li class="mb-2 text-white-50">Degree: B.Tech Computer Engineering</li>
                    <li class="mb-2 text-white-50">Semester: Semester 5</li>
                    <li class="mb-2 text-white-50">Subject: .NET Technologies</li>
                    <li class="mb-2 text-white-50">Team: 2-Student Collaborative Project</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="col-12 col-md-3">
                <h6 class="text-white fw-bold mb-3">Security & Transparency</h6>
                <p class="small text-white-50 mb-2">
                    Password security via PBKDF2 SHA-256 with cryptographic salting. Strict ADO.NET parameterized queries to guarantee SQL injection immunity.
                </p>
                <span class="badge bg-secondary">Pure .NET 10 LTS Architecture</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-top border-secondary border-opacity-25 mt-4 pt-3 d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between align-items-center small">
            <div>&copy; @DateTime.UtcNow.Year AI Resume Analyzer. All rights reserved. Academic Project.</div>
            <div class="text-white-50 mt-2 mt-md-0">Engineered with ASP.NET Core &amp; ADO.NET</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
